  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place the potato on to a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-0ddec3f1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and cucumber.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-7a2adf05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine plant-based crumbed chicken, garlic & herb seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-bf0a5b88.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: The chicken is cooked when it is no longer pink inside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-56254151.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, crumble fetta cubes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, cucumber, fetta and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-8c9f9b11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with roasted potatoes, add the basil pesto and toss to combine.\n• Divide herby chick'n, pesto potatoes and fetta salad between plates.\n• Serve with mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8f0be0c3945380007b16a/step-c7e9d7ef.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
